SUMMARY:Healthcare Coverage & Access: A Newcomer's Guide (SHAMS Workshop)
DESCRIPTION:Navigating healthcare in a new country can be challenging. Join Project SHAMS and Scadding Court Community Centre for a free\, interactive workshop designed to help newcomers and refugees better understand Ontario's healthcare system\, learn about healthcare coverage\, and find essential health and community services. Free. Register: https://forms.gle/ipEVd8Np1tDy1GVD7
